      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "This is awesome!\n\n\nAs @jordancarlin said, this is not an ISA Extension, so it shouldn't (1) be in the isa folder and (2) follow the ext.schema. Instead, it should be in spec/std/non-isa and follow the spec/schemas/non_isa_schema.json.\n\nYou're obviously the first one porting one non-isa extension to UDB, and thus this may require a few iterations to get right. If you're willing to do these changes, I'll be here to help and thank you for it!",
    "state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/riscv/riscv-unified-db/pull/1431#pullrequestreview-3730222266",
    "pull_request_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv/riscv-unified-db/pulls/1431",
