      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "All my requests are done, thanks. \n\nThough, I am still not approcing this as I am unsure if the differences between normative and non-normative are correctly specified and would like to ask @BKhristenko  to help in this regards. \n\nNot directly tied to your PR, I don't think we have a way of building a doc of just one non-isa spec. That would be worthy and I may contribute to it, if we don't already. Seems like an important step as non-isa specs are currently held on their own, and we should at least allow that to happen in UDB. ",
